\right.\] If $a$ is negative, find $a$ so that $g(g(g(10.5)))=g(g(g(a)))$.

solution:
We begin with a diagram of the given information: [asy]
size(4cm);
real x=sqrt(3);
pair d=(2,0); pair c=(1,x); pair b=(-1,x); pair a=-d; pair f=-c; pair e=-b;
